  - m_Id: 517884928319488
    m_Key: Yours forever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816343937024
    m_Key: Put its pictured piece above the bomb. Stop it before the count reaches
      zero.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131328
    m_Key: Put its pictured piece above the key. The branch opens and you can swap
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131329
    m_Key: Put its pictured piece above the toolbox. It repairs this board once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131330
    m_Key: Match the spool picture. You earn one swap past one or two pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131331
    m_Key: Match the stamp picture, then finish the level to keep your bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131332
    m_Key: Match the hourglass picture. The bomb waits two swaps. The wood still
      wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131333
    m_Key: You can swap across this bridge once. Then that path closes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131334
    m_Key: These pairs are tied together. Swap one pair and the other swaps too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131335
    m_Key: A swap at the cracked spot uses twice as much wood. Try another path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131336
    m_Key: The branch blocks this swap. Use another pair or go down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131337
    m_Key: This board slides the whole row when it lands. Watch the arrow before
      going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131338
    m_Key: This board turns the row around on landing. The last piece becomes the
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131339
    m_Key: Wind moves the whole row one place on landing. Look at the arrow before
      going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131340
    m_Key: A gust rocks the boards and pieces. They settle back into place. Your
      order stays safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131341
    m_Key: Follow the hand for each next move. The scroll lasts until this board
      breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131342
    m_Key: After two free undos, this spool undoes one more move on the same board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131343
    m_Key: The hourglass brings back the last broken board in this stage. Later moves
      are undone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
