      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205326
    m_Key: The lantern makes one safe move for you. It uses wood just like your own
      move. Once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205327
    m_Key: See where the pieces will land if you go down now. Nothing moves until
