    m_Key: Rare parcel or coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318567
    m_Key: 'Lights for a parcel: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318568
    m_Key: A little surprise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318569
    m_Key: 20 coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318570
    m_Key: +20 coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318571
    m_Key: New look for Mika!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318572
    m_Key: A reward for your journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318573
    m_Key: Yours to keep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318574
    m_Key: Explorer hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318575
    m_Key: Frog suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318576
    m_Key: Star knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318577
    m_Key: Fox mask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318578
    m_Key: Explorer hat, drifting leaves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318579
    m_Key: Frog hood, soft raindrops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318580
    m_Key: Knight cape, twinkling stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318581
    m_Key: Fox mask, floating petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318582
    m_Key: Test video
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318583
    m_Key: Could not save. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318584
    m_Key: Choose a look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318585
    m_Key: I signed every bridge I built. Now my name is on a pile of broken boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318586
    m_Key: Bram. Builder, bread lover. I test the boards before I butter the bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318587
    m_Key: We'll mend this crossing first. Then I can see where the light needs to
      go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318588
    m_Key: He's lined up three buckets. We'd better fill one before he finds a fourth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318589
    m_Key: He copied my spinning trick. I need to show him how to stop, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318590
    m_Key: I planted this tree when I was small. I saved its seeds before the fruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318591
    m_Key: I'll plant one by Gran's window. She can watch for the first leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318592
    m_Key: I argued with an old friend. I've carried an apology in my pocket for
      months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318593
    m_Key: What do you want her to hear? You can tell me before you write it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318594
    m_Key: That I was wrong. Somehow I keep writing about the weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318595
    m_Key: I'd want to read that, even if the rest of the page stayed empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318596
    m_Key: Then we won't take it. I'll trace the road onto a spare page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318597
    m_Key: My teacher drew every bend. Leave me the original; I'll check your copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318598
    m_Key: You check the turns. I'll mark a dry place for us to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318599
    m_Key: The first marker is under that drift. I'll clear it if you hold the lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318600
    m_Key: One bearing was wrong. I shut the chart and kept checking it alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318601
    m_Key: Show me the mark you trust. I'll check it from the other side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318602
    m_Key: The first crossing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318603
    m_Key: I'll mark the first missing board. Tell me when you're ready to cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318604
    m_Key: Ready to help, yes. Ready to look down... not yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318605
    m_Key: One gear, one bucket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318606
    m_Key: I'll fit this gear. My brother can hold the bucket where it's dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318607
    m_Key: I'll check the pipe. A turning wheel won't help if the bucket stays empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318608
    m_Key: A pocket of seeds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318609
    m_Key: Take three seeds. The rest stay here, for the orchard after us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318610
    m_Key: Three seeds, one letter. I'll ask Gran for a pot when we get home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318611
    m_Key: The first honest sentence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318612
    m_Key: I'll write the apology. Please keep the other letters out of that puddle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318613
    m_Key: I'll gather them. Leave your letter on top, where you can see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318614
    m_Key: The nearest lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318615
    m_Key: That first lamp is beside the pier. We can reach it from dry boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318616
    m_Key: Show me that one. I'll think about the farther shore when we get there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318617
    m_Key: A map for the road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318618
    m_Key: Hold that corner. This copy needs the shelter, not every mountain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318619
    m_Key: And room for anything we find. I'll bring those notes back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318620
    m_Key: Half a scarf each
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318621
    m_Key: I led Pip through this fog once. Today I could use a paw to follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318622
    m_Key: Here. Keep half the scarf, and stop me if I start hurrying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318623
    m_Key: The keeper's lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318624
    m_Key: Take my lamp. I'll hold the rail; you watch the wick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318625
    m_Key: Your lamp and mine. I'll keep them low until the lift is steady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318626
    m_Key: A second reading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318627
    m_Key: The moon dial should point there. I haven't had a second reading in months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318628
    m_Key: You read the scale. I'll hold the light, then we can swap places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318629
    m_Key: Bram. I built these bridges. The boards survived better than my confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318630
    m_Key: Neri. Stay on the pier with me. We can start from dry boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318631
    m_Key: Toma. No wet paws on the maps. Wet paws may use the towel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318632
    m_Key: Aster. I've checked this chart six times. It still needs another observer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318633
    m_Key: I crossed the whole bridge. First time since the storm. The bread got
      here warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318634
    m_Key: Your brother put his bucket down. He can use both paws to wave now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318635
    m_Key: My three seeds are still dry. One day their fruit will light this road
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318636
    m_Key: My letter went with the basket. I wrote the apology, not the weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318637
    m_Key: You sent it. Now she gets to choose her first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318638
    m_Key: The water gate is open. Mother's boat can follow its old lamps again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318639
    m_Key: I stayed for the whole launch. Next time I'll help with the sail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318640
    m_Key: The copy has every turn. I added the shelter my teacher forgot to mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318641
    m_Key: I'll add a mark when we stop there. You'll know we found it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318642
    m_Key: The shelter is warm. I kept saying I was fine; my paws say otherwise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318643
    m_Key: Sit with me. I'll mark this stop on Toma's map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318644
    m_Key: The sky lantern is up. I held the rail this time, and you held the light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318645
    m_Key: I nearly turned back at Bram's bridge. I'm glad I told him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318646
    m_Key: I marked the gap instead of hiding it. The gliders can use the route we
      checked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318647
    m_Key: Sora can carry the corrected chart. She'll want a copy for the post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318648
    m_Key: This bridge leads to Pip. I left my lunch on this side every day since
      the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318649
    m_Key: One gear first. Last time I spun the wheel before my brother moved his
      bucket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318650
    m_Key: The seed house is cold. I planted my first tree from a tray just like
      this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318651
    m_Key: The mail basket is heavy. My apology is on top; I promised not to hide
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318652
    m_Key: I'll hold the basket. You can check the address one last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318653
    m_Key: Each lamp marks a turn. Mother taught me the route; I still count them
      aloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318654
    m_Key: This is my teacher's last map. I won't risk it under an open sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318655
    m_Key: Then let me trace the route. Your map can stay dry here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318656
    m_Key: I built this shelter after guiding Pip home. I'd forgotten how low its
      door is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318657
    m_Key: The lantern lift jammed in the storm. I kept its parts in my soup pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318658
    m_Key: Let's put them back. Then you can use the pot for supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318659
    m_Key: The wind took one corner of this chart. I stopped sharing the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318660
    m_Key: I can hear the water. Once the pipe is clear, my brother can put his bucket
      down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318661
    m_Key: He can carry his tea cup instead. Bram saved him a slice of bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318662
    m_Key: Mother called this boat Leaf. I called every boat Leaf for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318663
    m_Key: Then this one is Little Leaf. It deserves a lamp of its own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318664
    m_Key: There are biscuit crumbs in this map. My teacher used it as a tray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318665
    m_Key: Then a little rain won't be its strangest journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318666
    m_Key: That gust lifts the snow sideways. Even the path needs a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318667
    m_Key: I'll wait with you. The beacon won't run away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318668
    m_Key: You've tucked Rue's seeds beside the wick. Mind they don't get toasted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318669
    m_Key: They're for your window. First we'll find them a pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318670
    m_Key: I left blank spaces on the chart. Blank isn't the same as wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318671
    m_Key: I'll draw the clouds lightly. We can rub them out tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318672
    m_Key: I checked that joint again. No creak. I might walk over for lunch tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318673
    m_Key: I'll wait on the far side. With bread, if the baker has any left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318674
    m_Key: 'I wrote: I was wrong to leave without listening. Now the page can dry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318675
    m_Key: I'll keep the bag open for it. No hiding it underneath this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318676
    m_Key: The original is back on its shelf. Your copy already has a new shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318677
    m_Key: I'll pencil in each place we stop. The next traveller can use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318678
    m_Key: I burnt the soup twice watching that bridge. You can stir while I watch
      the wick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318679
    m_Key: Gladly. And I've brought enough stories to last until it's ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318680
    m_Key: I put two pencils by the chart. Someone sharpened the spare while we worked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318681
    m_Key: Leave the second stool there. They may want to finish their drawing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318682
    m_Key: I kept the boards dry. The next crossing still needs a lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318683
    m_Key: I'll carry it. You can show me where the sound boards go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318684
    m_Key: My brother's bucket reminds me who I'm keeping this wheel turning for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318685
    m_Key: Good. Let's check where the water will come out first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318686
    m_Key: Mind that low nest. The birds use this path too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318687
    m_Key: I'll keep the light below it. Have you found a dry place for the seeds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318688
    m_Key: Sky post! One bag for deliveries, one pocket for my apology.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318689
    m_Key: I'll carry the bag. You keep that pocket where you can reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318690
    m_Key: The nearest lamp is still our first stop. I can hold the boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318691
    m_Key: I'll bring the light along the pier. Tell me when the boat is ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318692
    m_Key: One travelling copy. One dry original. I have counted them twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318693
    m_Key: I'll bring back the copy with our stops marked. Keep a pencil for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318694
    m_Key: The wind has covered another marker. Stay within reach of my scarf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318695
    m_Key: Only if you stay within reach of mine. We can stop whenever you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318696
    m_Key: The lamp is ready. My knees would like the handrail checked first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318697
    m_Key: I'll check them. Then we can carry the light side by side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318698
    m_Key: I left the chart open this time. There is a pencil for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318699
    m_Key: I'll mark what I can see. You can check it against the dial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318700
    m_Key: There may be news for Gran in those letters. Let's bring them down safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318701
    m_Key: I'll hold the lamp. Tell me if the snow has swallowed the next step, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420247281664
    m_Key: Atmosphere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447488
    m_Key: Frames
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447489
    m_Key: Use this style
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447490
    m_Key: Remove style
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447491
    m_Key: Buy with coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447492
    m_Key: Coins only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447493
    m_Key: Petal breeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447494
    m_Key: Firefly dance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447495
    m_Key: Butterfly garden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447496
    m_Key: Swallow flock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447497
    m_Key: Dragonfly stream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447498
    m_Key: Flying lanterns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447499
    m_Key: Snow wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447500
    m_Key: Comet trails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641792
    m_Key: Garden frame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641793
    m_Key: Sky frame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641794
    m_Key: Copper frame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641795
    m_Key: Lunar frame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641796
    m_Key: Petals and garden visitors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641797
    m_Key: Soft firefly lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641798
    m_Key: Butterflies and drifting pollen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641799
    m_Key: Birds in the distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641800
    m_Key: Dragonflies over the islands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641801
    m_Key: Slow floating lanterns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641802
    m_Key: Snowflakes and winter birds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641803
    m_Key: Falling stars and moon moths
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641804
    m_Key: Leaves around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641805
    m_Key: Feathers around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641806
    m_Key: Copper around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420280836096
    m_Key: Moonlight around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 952944215187456
    m_Key: Scene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572045967360
    m_Key: That joint is holding. I still hear the storm in every creak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161664
    m_Key: I hear it too. Will you try the next board with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161665
    m_Key: The hinge is quieter. My knees are jealous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161666
    m_Key: Your knees can take a break. I'll stay beside the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161667
    m_Key: The lift rises a little now. I wish my stomach would stay in the workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161668
    m_Key: Mine wants to stay too. Shall we test it without passengers first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161669
    m_Key: One lamp is back. The baker says worrying burns more bread than her oven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161670
    m_Key: Then we'll give her something else to watch. A second lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161671
    m_Key: I packed two lunches. Habit. I wasn't sure I'd dare bring even one across.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161672
    m_Key: Keep mine warm, Bram. I'm not crossing without you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161673
    m_Key: It caught once! I nearly cheered right into the gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161674
    m_Key: I heard it too. Your brother will want to hear the whole turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161675
    m_Key: There's a trickle here. I used to stop checking as soon as the wheel moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161676
    m_Key: Let's walk to your brother's bucket. Water needs to get there, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161677
    m_Key: My brother wants the first turn. I keep reaching for his bucket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161678
    m_Key: Let him try the rope when it's ready. You can stand beside him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161679
    m_Key: We can finish one seam at a time. She'll see you kept at it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161680
    m_Key: Rue asked for one cup. I brought three. I always overfill apologies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161681
    m_Key: Bring the cups. I'll tell her you remembered the seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161682
    m_Key: One branch glows. That robin is checking every nest before it trusts us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161683
    m_Key: It can take its time. So can we.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161684
    m_Key: That root is older than my bridge. I won't cut it to save a few steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161685
    m_Key: Then the road can bend. Roots can't pick another way home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161686
    m_Key: The path is clearing. I kept the jars here so long I nearly ate winter's
      share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161687
    m_Key: Let's save Gran one. She'd want to hear the story before tasting it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161688
    m_Key: A little warmth at last. My first tree began smaller than your button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161689
    m_Key: I'll keep its three seeds near me. Gran has a sunny window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161690
    m_Key: Sora's scarf caught on that branch once. She called it an unscheduled
      delivery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161691
    m_Key: When she visits again, you can tell her the branch still remembers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161692
    m_Key: I found a letter to a new baby. I've been late for their very first hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161693
    m_Key: They'll still get the hello. We'll keep looking for the others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161694
    m_Key: Your gran's envelope has worn corners. You've held it through every gust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161695
    m_Key: One landing board is steady. I used to think flying made me independent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161696
    m_Key: A place to land helps. So does someone keeping it ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161697
    m_Key: My letter is still on top. I keep finding reasons to check the stamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161698
    m_Key: The stamp won't answer you, Sora. Your friend might.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161699
    m_Key: I can see Neri's shore. I used to wave from above and count that as a
      visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161700
    m_Key: When the gate opens, stay awhile. I'll carry your bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161701
    m_Key: These boards hold. Mother taught me to leave room for a frightened passenger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161702
    m_Key: Leave room for me, then. I'm still frightened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161703
    m_Key: Two lamps so far. I still hear Mother naming each turn when I count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161704
    m_Key: Say them aloud. I'd like to learn her road from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161705
    m_Key: The gate has shifted. Little Leaf keeps tapping, as if I'm late for supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161706
    m_Key: We'll get her home. Will you hold the boat when I step aboard?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161707
    m_Key: The pond light flickered. Mother always cupped her paws round it like
      this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161708
    m_Key: I can hold it that way. Show me once more before we leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161709
    m_Key: The archive path is clearer. Toma may ask what you'll give back for his
      map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161710
    m_Key: Dry paws first. Then I'll ask what he needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161711
    m_Key: The door moves a little. I'd counted every page before I checked the hinge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161712
    m_Key: Then let's give the hinge a little of that attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161713
    m_Key: One shelf is free. I keep reaching for a knot that isn't there anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161714
    m_Key: Your books are staying put. You can let your paws rest too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161715
    m_Key: The first turns are copied. My teacher used to leave room for other paws'
      notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161716
    m_Key: I'll leave that room too. I won't know every turn on the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161717
    m_Key: The ink is holding. I nearly thanked your scarf before I thanked you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161718
    m_Key: Gran would accept thanks for the scarf. I'll take a dry page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161719
    m_Key: I can reach one corner of Gran's note. I've kept it away from damp for
      so long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161720
    m_Key: A little longer, then. I'd rather hear her words than hurry and blur them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161721
    m_Key: Three lamps found. I said I knew the road, then the snow covered my proof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161722
    m_Key: You knew where to look. Let me clear enough to see with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161723
    m_Key: The shelter is less draughty. I'm sorry I kept telling you my paws were
      warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161724
    m_Key: Mine weren't either. We can say so sooner next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161725
    m_Key: Near side checked. I dislike a crossing I can't see the end of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161726
    m_Key: Then we wait for a clear view. I can be brave after a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161727
    m_Key: Pip folded this blanket badly. That crooked corner has kept my paw warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161728
    m_Key: It fits two travellers anyway. Pip thought further ahead than he knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161729
    m_Key: That window keeps appearing between gusts. I know the road; I can't quiet
      the sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161730
    m_Key: I'll wait with you. Gran kept her lamp on; I can keep mine on too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161731
    m_Key: You mend that joint like Bram. I still remember your paws barely reaching
      mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161732
    m_Key: They shook on his bridge, Gran. He stayed until I could take a step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161733
    m_Key: One pulley turns. I suppose my soup pot will eventually get its proper
      job back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161734
    m_Key: Pip would ask to check the far end first. I'll do that, then stir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161735
    m_Key: The first steps are bright. I kept thinking I ought to carry you as I
      used to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161736
    m_Key: Let me carry the light this time. You can lean on me if you need to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161737
    m_Key: The lantern is rising a little. You brought it all this way without letting
      go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161738
    m_Key: Not by myself. Neri held the boat, and Lumi held on to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161739
    m_Key: The lens catches a small glow. I still check the window, even with you
      beside me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161740
    m_Key: Someone else may be looking for home. Let's keep a light for them too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161741
    m_Key: Two ticks agree. I used to trust a number more than a second pair of eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161742
    m_Key: You can trust both. Mine get tired too; we'll take turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161743
    m_Key: A board still needs fixing. I drew its missing edge instead of stepping
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161744
    m_Key: Your drawing helped us find it. Now I'll hold the lantern while you look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161745
    m_Key: I've joined these pieces. There's still a gap where I once guessed a bearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161746
    m_Key: Mark the gap. Sora needs to know where to look as much as where to fly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161747
    m_Key: I like the view beside you. Leave a little room for my tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161748
    m_Key: The gate stirs. I keep rehearsing what to say when a traveller arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161749
    m_Key: Start with 'come and sit'. That's how my best roads began.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161750
    m_Key: Half the hull is patched. I promised Sora a boat, not a floating sieve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161751
    m_Key: I chose words all night. In the end, I just wrote that I missed her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161752
    m_Key: One pattern shines. I used to tell myself company would spoil the quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271629819904
    m_Key: Mushroom hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014208
    m_Key: Bee costume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014209
    m_Key: Winter hood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014210
    m_Key: Sky pirate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014211
    m_Key: Cloud jester
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014212
    m_Key: Star mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014213
    m_Key: Mushroom hat, drifting leaves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014214
    m_Key: Bee costume, warm motes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014215
    m_Key: Winter hood, soft snowfall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014216
    m_Key: Pirate hat, falling feathers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014217
    m_Key: Jester suit, floating petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014218
    m_Key: Mage cloak, twinkling stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014219
    m_Key: Ribbon kites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014220
    m_Key: Paper cranes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014221
    m_Key: Dream bubbles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014222
    m_Key: Aurora veil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014223
    m_Key: Kites with trailing ribbons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014224
    m_Key: Folded wings in the breeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014225
    m_Key: Pearl bubbles drifting upward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014226
    m_Key: Soft curtains of northern light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382117916672
    m_Key: I marked the boards that held. Tomorrow I want to cross without counting
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110976
    m_Key: Keep the marks. Courage can have a little help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110977
    m_Key: I made this gate for Pip. He used to race its shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110978
    m_Key: Then let's leave him something familiar when he comes back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110979
    m_Key: My first lift carried nothing but a potato. Father insisted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305280
    m_Key: A very brave potato. We can start that small too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305281
    m_Key: The market went quiet after the storm. I miss being asked to fix things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305282
    m_Key: I'll tell them who brought the lamps back. Bring your toolbox tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305283
    m_Key: Tell Pip I checked every bolt. No, tell him I'm coming myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305284
    m_Key: He'll like the second message better. So do I.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305285
    m_Key: Bram says a wheel needs listening, not cheering. I can do both quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305286
    m_Key: I'll listen on this side. Tell me when you hear the knock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305287
    m_Key: I promised everyone water before breakfast. That was three breakfasts
      ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305288
    m_Key: Tell them where we've reached. They can wait better when they know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305289
    m_Key: He tied that knot himself. I nearly fixed it before looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305290
    m_Key: It holds. Maybe ask him to show us the next one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305291
    m_Key: Sora painted a little bird here. I thought it was just a stain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305292
    m_Key: Let's mend around it. She should recognise her boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305293
    m_Key: I forgot the orchard needed water too. I only saw our empty well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305294
    m_Key: Now you've noticed. We can carry the first cups together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305295
    m_Key: Those nests were here before my lanterns. I'm a guest too, really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305296
    m_Key: Then we'll make a quiet light. Enough to find home, not wake everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305297
    m_Key: Bram offered a straight bridge. I asked him to walk the old path first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305298
    m_Key: Did he see the nests? I'll show him the ones near the bend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305299
    m_Key: Gran always returned her jars with a note inside. I kept every one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305300
    m_Key: Would you put a note in hers this time? I'll deliver it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305301
    m_Key: Seeds don't promise they'll grow. I plant them anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305302
    m_Key: I'll ask Gran for a pot. We can send you news of the first leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305303
    m_Key: Sora hasn't stopped here since she lost the mail. She thinks I'm angry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305304
    m_Key: I'll tell her there's still a place at your table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305305
    m_Key: I know every address, but I hardly know who waits behind the doors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305306
    m_Key: This time we can knock and stay for an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305307
    m_Key: I thought a good letter had to sound clever. Yours sounds like you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305308
    m_Key: Gran will know who wrote it before she sees my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305309
    m_Key: Bram left extra nails. He said landing is part of flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305310
    m_Key: He knows more about the sky than he thinks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305311
    m_Key: If Neri doesn't answer, will you still walk with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305312
    m_Key: Yes. But we should give her time to read it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305313
    m_Key: I'm taking the slow boat this time. No waving from the clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305314
    m_Key: Then she can wave back and know you've seen her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305315
    m_Key: I kept Mother's boat tied up. It felt safer than making new memories in
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305316
    m_Key: We don't have to go far. The first trip can end right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305317
    m_Key: This one is Heron Bend. She named it after a bird that stole our lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305318
    m_Key: I'll remember that one. And keep our lunch under the seat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305319
    m_Key: Sora wrote that she's coming by boat. She never used to have the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305320
    m_Key: Maybe leave a second cushion ready. You needn't decide what to say yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305321
    m_Key: I thought I'd forget her voice if someone else learned her little rituals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305322
    m_Key: When I do this, I'll remember who taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305323
    m_Key: Tell Toma his towel is still in my boat. I washed it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305324
    m_Key: I'll return it with your message. A dry introduction should help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305325
    m_Key: People stopped visiting when I made too many rules about the books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305326
    m_Key: Keep the towel. Perhaps lose the rule about whispering outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305327
    m_Key: I tied every shelf after the storm. Then I couldn't reach my favourite
      book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305328
    m_Key: Which one is it? We'll leave it somewhere you can reach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305329
    m_Key: 'This margin says: a fox found a shorter path. My teacher trusted strangers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305330
    m_Key: Someone had to let the fox borrow the map first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305331
    m_Key: Gran spilled tea on this page years ago. I kept the stain in every copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305332
    m_Key: She'll laugh when I tell her. She always blamed the cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305333
    m_Key: She asked me to share the route, not guard it. I read that rather late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305334
    m_Key: We're here now. May I take a copy for the next traveller?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305335
    m_Key: I used to follow my own tracks home. Today yours are beside them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305336
    m_Key: Two sets should be easier to find when we turn back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305337
    m_Key: I thought a guide wasn't allowed to need a blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305338
    m_Key: I'd rather follow a warm guide. Here, take this end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305339
    m_Key: The old bridge rang in winter. I miss knowing where I was by its sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305340
    m_Key: When it's safe again, let's stop and listen before crossing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305341
    m_Key: I owe Pip a letter. I never thanked him for sending this ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305342
    m_Key: Sora can carry it. She's learning to stop for replies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305343
    m_Key: I can take you to her door. Will you come back and tell me how she is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305344
    m_Key: Come in with me. Gran always puts out another cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305345
    m_Key: I rehearsed a brave welcome. All I wanted was to hear your paws outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305346
    m_Key: You don't have to be brave for me, Gran. I'm here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305347
    m_Key: I repaired that lift alone for years. Asking Bram felt like admitting
      my age.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305348
    m_Key: He misses being needed. You'd be giving him something too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305349
    m_Key: Your little paw used to fit on this stair. You insisted on climbing yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305350
    m_Key: I still do. But now I know I can hold your paw too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305351
    m_Key: I kept the lantern bright so no one would guess I was tired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305352
    m_Key: Let me take a turn. You can sit where you can see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305353
    m_Key: Beyond our beacon, Aster keeps watch alone. I should have visited sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305354
    m_Key: We'll take him tea. This time the light comes with company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305355
    m_Key: I thought the sky had changed. Perhaps I forgot how to ask for another
      view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305356
    m_Key: I'll stand here. Tell me what you see, and I'll tell you mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305357
    m_Key: This telescope belonged to my sister. She was never afraid to turn it
      elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305358
    m_Key: What did she like looking for? We can try her favourite corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305359
    m_Key: Toma left blank space on this chart. I nearly filled it before looking
      up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305360
    m_Key: Let's leave room for something neither of us has noticed yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305361
    m_Key: That little cluster looks like a teapot to me. The book calls it a crown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305362
    m_Key: Gran would choose the teapot. Can a sky have both names?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305363
    m_Key: I'll leave the door unlatched tonight. Someone may want to see what we
      found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305364
    m_Key: And tomorrow I'll bring our friends. Save a little sky for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029391699968
    m_Key: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894272
    m_Key: Look closer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894273
    m_Key: Unavailable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894274
    m_Key: Choose a tool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894275
    m_Key: Choose a level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894276
    m_Key: Without help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894277
    m_Key: Visits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894278
    m_Key: Next parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894279
    m_Key: Saved on this phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894280
    m_Key: Available on your phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894281
    m_Key: Try another way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894282
    m_Key: Retry is free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894283
    m_Key: Shows moves until this board breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894284
    m_Key: One extra undo on this board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894285
    m_Key: Returns the last board and its row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894286
    m_Key: Makes one safe move. Uses wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894287
    m_Key: Shows the next landing before you drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894288
    m_Key: Watch, then follow the hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894289
    m_Key: 2 tools per stage. Up to 2 stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894290
    m_Key: Test only. No payment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894291
    m_Key: Removes ad breaks. Reward videos stay optional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894292
    m_Key: Ad breaks are off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894293
    m_Key: 'New puzzles: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1096096339189760
    m_Key: Ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1189116615057408
    m_Key: Stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1225130616283136
    m_Key: Stage {0}/3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241003825553408
    m_Key: Drag onto a neighbour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241003829747712
    m_Key: Tap one, then its neighbour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322146058240
    m_Key: Next level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252544
    m_Key: +{0} moves before breaking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252545
    m_Key: 'Stamp: +100 points'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252546
    m_Key: Drag one piece onto another, or tap both. Every exchange wears down the
      board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252547
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the toolbox. It adds the shown number of
      moves before the board breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252548
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the key. The locked link opens for exchanges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252549
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the bomb before its counter runs out. A blast
      removes board durability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252550
    m_Key: Collect the ribbon with the pictured piece. Then exchange two pieces up
      to three places apart once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252551
    m_Key: Collect the frost flask. The bomb waits for two exchanges, but the board
      still wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252552
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the stamp for 100 bonus points. The receiver
      still needs the exact row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252553
    m_Key: 'This link works once. Plan the row before crossing it: it closes after
      the exchange.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252554
    m_Key: Exchange one marked pair and both marked pairs move together. One move
      changes four positions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252555
    m_Key: An exchange across a cracked link costs two durability instead of one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252556
    m_Key: Pieces cannot cross a closed link. Go down to a board with the links you
      need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252557
    m_Key: When the row lands on this board, its order reverses. Prepare the row
      before going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252558
    m_Key: On landing, every piece moves one place in the arrow direction. The end
      piece wraps around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252559
    m_Key: After the shown number of exchanges, wind shifts the whole row one place.
      Plan for the shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252560
    m_Key: Undo returns the pieces and board to before your last move. You have two
      free returns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252561
    m_Key: Go down early to use the next board. The row stays with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252562
    m_Key: The lantern shows one useful move. Follow it on the real row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252563
    m_Key: Watch what changes, then try it on your row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1268672927621120
    m_Key: +{0} durability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1268672936009728
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the toolbox. It restores the shown durability
      for more exchanges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948832231424
    m_Key: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425728
    m_Key: Decline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425729
    m_Key: Continue mission
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425730
    m_Key: Personal mission, stage {0}/3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425731
    m_Key: Thank you! The delivery helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425732
    m_Key: Mend the boards and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425733
    m_Key: Open the route with the key and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425734
    m_Key: Deal with the bombs and deliver the row safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425735
    m_Key: Use the ribbon to reach across the row and deliver it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425736
    m_Key: Collect the stamps and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425737
    m_Key: Cross the one-use bridges and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425738
    m_Key: Move the linked pairs into order and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425739
    m_Key: Plan around the fragile boards and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425740
    m_Key: Prepare for the changing row and bring it home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425741
    m_Key: Find a route through the closed paths and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425742
    m_Key: Put my scattered supplies in order and bring them home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425743
    m_Key: The bridge needs supplies. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425744
    m_Key: The garden needs water from my mill. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425745
    m_Key: My lantern grove needs a delivery. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425746
    m_Key: The wind scattered the sky post. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425747
    m_Key: The harbour is waiting for supplies. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425748
    m_Key: The library needs these parcels. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425749
    m_Key: The snow road needs warm lights. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425750
    m_Key: The beacon needs a special delivery. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425751
    m_Key: The observatory needs new lenses. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1402326270074880
    m_Key: Saved here. Older level results need verification before cloud transfer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1417343845523456
    m_Key: Purchases are temporarily unavailable. Contact support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013172908032
    m_Key: Sign in with Apple or Google
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102336
    m_Key: Manage account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102337
    m_Key: Keep this phone's save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102338
    m_Key: Apple or Google protects your progress and verified purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1570345583632384
    m_Key: '{0} move'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489219325952
    m_Key: Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297472
    m_Key: Terms of Use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297473
    m_Key: Support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297474
    m_Key: Open on website
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297475
    m_Key: Full documents are in English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297476
    m_Key: Purchase restoration needs the store connection. No coins are spent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1619703867891712
    m_Key: Free hint used
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984198168576
    m_Key: If the beacon goes dark, stay off the upper bridges. I'll keep my window
      lamp lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362880
    m_Key: That was Gran's last message. The beacon is dark now. I need to reach
      her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362881
    m_Key: The cargo lifts still work. Each landing takes its supplies in a marked
      order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362882
    m_Key: So I sort the load on the way down. You use what arrives to repair our
      crossing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362883
    m_Key: Yes. The receiver won't take a mixed-up load. These worn boards won't
      wait forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362884
    m_Key: Then show me the order at the bottom. I'll get the first load to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362885
    m_Key: I'm Mika. Gran is at the dark beacon. I need a safe way to reach her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362886
    m_Key: The loaded boat stays dry. Sora can collect mail from the village again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362887
    m_Key: Then I'll take my letter to her at the sky post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362888
    m_Key: I'll help gather them. Then I have a letter of my own to send to Gran.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362889
    m_Key: Mine is still in my pocket. Now we can send it with the recovered mail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362890
    m_Key: Your letter has left for the beacon. The next keeper will carry it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362891
    m_Key: Neri's pier is beyond the lagoon gate. I sent the apology; now I need
      to listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362892
    m_Key: I'll go with you. She can tell us if she wants company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362893
    m_Key: The pier is safe. Tell Sora she may come ashore. We have things to talk
      about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362894
    m_Key: I'll tell her. And I'll stay by the lamp while you talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362895
    m_Key: Gran's note marks the sheltered approach to the beacon. Lumi knows that
      ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362896
    m_Key: Let's find Lumi. We'll take your copy and bring back the missing turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362897
    m_Key: The copy marks the known turns and the gap. Lumi will check that part
      on the ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362898
    m_Key: The beacon road is clear. Gran answered your signal; she knows we're coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362899
    m_Key: She saw us! Let's keep the lamp raised until we reach the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362900
    m_Key: Bram's bridge, Pip's mill... they're answering. Our way home is their
      road, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362901
    m_Key: Now we can check the part of the route the tower was hiding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362902
    m_Key: A delivery cart broke the footbridge rail. I need parts before it returns.
      {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362903
    m_Key: My brother's new well has a leaking valve. Help me get a replacement to
      him. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362904
    m_Key: A nest is stranded beyond the orchard path. I need a lamp for its tree.
      {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362905
    m_Key: A mail basket missed its landing. Help me recover it before the envelopes
      get wet. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362906
    m_Key: A boat is waiting at the unlit pier. Will you bring a lamp down to it?
      {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362907
    m_Key: The roof needs another patch. Help me deliver the tiles before the next
      rain. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362908
    m_Key: Travellers used the shelter's last fuel. Let's refill it before nightfall.
      {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362909
    m_Key: The spare wick has arrived below the beacon. Will you bring it up with
      me? {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362910
    m_Key: A cracked lens hides the eastern route. Help me deliver a new one intact.
      {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362911
    m_Key: The far anchor pulled loose, not the boards. My first repair missed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362912
    m_Key: Then we secure that end before anyone crosses. I'll hold the load here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362913
    m_Key: The gate opens, but the latch won't hold. One gust could slam it shut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362914
    m_Key: Let's test the latch before we send the lift through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362915
    m_Key: The empty lift runs. I haven't trusted it with a passenger since the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362916
    m_Key: Send the tools first. If they arrive safely, I'll take the next trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362917
    m_Key: The baker won't open after dark. She can't see the gap by her door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362918
    m_Key: The next lamp goes there, then. Bread can wait; a safe doorway can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362919
    m_Key: Pip asked for my tools. I've packed them every morning, then stayed home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362920
    m_Key: Bring them with us today. You can tell him yourself what needs fixing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362921
    m_Key: The wheel turns, but that knock means a tooth is still out of place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362922
    m_Key: Stop it while we fit the last pieces. Faster won't make them fit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362923
    m_Key: Water reaches this joint, then leaks away. The village still gets nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362924
    m_Key: I'll follow the pipe to the last house. We finish when their tap runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362925
    m_Key: My brother can lower the bucket. The handle slips when he pulls it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362926
    m_Key: Let's fix the handle for his paws, not yours. Then let him test it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362927
    m_Key: The boat floats empty. With the mail aboard, water comes through this
      seam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362928
    m_Key: Keep the letters ashore. We'll test it with the toolboxes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362929
    m_Key: Rue sent seeds when our mill failed. I still haven't taken her any water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362930
    m_Key: Fill a can. Once this crossing is ready, we'll carry it to her together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362931
    m_Key: That nest has chicks. Their parents won't leave while the branches are
      dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362932
    m_Key: We'll light their tree first. The harvest can wait until they can feed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362933
    m_Key: The broken support rests on a living root. Pull it out and both may fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362934
    m_Key: We'll brace the bridge, then free the root. We don't have to cut it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362935
    m_Key: These jars were promised to the mill. I've been rationing them here instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362936
    m_Key: Once the cart can pass, send the promised crate first. I'll help load
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362937
    m_Key: The seed trays are dry, but the night air gets in beneath the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362938
    m_Key: Let's seal the gap. I want these seeds to survive more than this one storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362939
    m_Key: Sora used this path every week. The unopened mail is still on my table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362940
    m_Key: Keep it for her. We'll reopen the path so she can collect it herself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362941
    m_Key: Two envelopes lost their addresses. I can't just choose a house for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362942
    m_Key: Bring them to the post desk. Someone may recognise the handwriting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362943
    m_Key: Your letter can leave with the next bag. Are you sure it's finished?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362944
    m_Key: I added everyone's names. Gran should know who is helping me reach her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362945
    m_Key: I can fly over the gap. The full mail cart can't. I forgot who uses this
      bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362946
    m_Key: Then test it with the cart. We'll leave a route everyone can use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362947
    m_Key: I keep checking the stamp on my apology. It's easier than sending it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362948
    m_Key: Put it in the basket yourself. I'll stay until it leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362949
    m_Key: Neri is the friend I wrote to. I don't know if she'll want to see me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362950
    m_Key: We can ask. Opening the path doesn't mean she owes us an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362951
    m_Key: Sora's letter arrived. I haven't answered. We still need this pier repaired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362952
    m_Key: We'll repair it. You can decide about the letter when you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362953
    m_Key: From shore, those lamps look alike. From a boat, one marks a dangerous
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362954
    m_Key: Show me from the boat, then. Hold it steady while I step in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362955
    m_Key: The gate catches the smallest sail. Mother always lowered it before passing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362956
    m_Key: We'll leave enough room for the sail. The next sailor may not know that
      trick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362957
    m_Key: This lamp was Mother's. I'd rather it lit your road than stayed on my
      shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362958
    m_Key: I'll bring it back. And I'll tell you where its light took us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362959
    m_Key: Tell Sora there's a place at my table. I still want to hear her say it
      aloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362960
    m_Key: I'll tell her before we leave for the archive. This message shouldn't
      wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362961
    m_Key: The door swelled in the rain. Forcing it will tear the map caught underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362962
    m_Key: Lift this corner with me. We can free the paper before opening the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362963
    m_Key: I tied the shelves together during the storm. Now I can't reach the roof
      ladder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362964
    m_Key: Brace one before moving the other. Your books can stay where they are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362965
    m_Key: My teacher left this turn blank. I've been afraid to admit the map is
      incomplete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362966
    m_Key: Mark the gap on my copy. Lumi can check it; a guess could send us off
      the ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362967
    m_Key: The leak is above the map cabinet. Saving one page won't keep the rest
      dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362968
    m_Key: I'll move the cabinet. You mend the roof before we uncover the maps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362969
    m_Key: Gran left this note before the storm. It tells us how to approach the
      beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362970
    m_Key: Then it's directions, not news. We'll still need to find out if she's
      safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362971
    m_Key: Your map leaves this fork blank. The old path ends at a fallen ledge now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362972
    m_Key: Let's mark the safe fork for Toma. Nobody should follow the old line blindly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362973
    m_Key: I said we could reach the beacon tonight. I can't feel my paws now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362974
    m_Key: Then we stop here. I'll light the shelter; you take Pip's blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362975
    m_Key: The near edge is sound. I can't see where the far one lands through this
      snow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362976
    m_Key: Let's secure the far landing before we cross. I can wait for a clear view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362977
    m_Key: Pip packed two blankets. I thought he'd miscounted. One is for the next
      traveller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362978
    m_Key: We'll leave it in the shelter, wrapped dry. He thought further ahead than
      us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362979
    m_Key: 'That window flashed twice. That''s a keeper''s signal: someone is there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362980
    m_Key: Gran taught me the reply. Hold my lantern high enough for her to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362981
    m_Key: I saw your reply from the window. I nearly came out onto the broken bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362982
    m_Key: Stay by the rail. I'll come to you as soon as this side holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362983
    m_Key: The lift jammed with the lens aboard. I couldn't bring it down alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362984
    m_Key: We won't pull against the jam. I'll unload it in the order you show me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362985
    m_Key: I left the upper lamps dark to save oil. I was waiting for you to come
      home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362986
    m_Key: I'm here now. Let's light the stairs for both of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557184
    m_Key: Two small flames won't make the beacon brighter unless the lens is aligned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557185
    m_Key: You watch the beam. I'll adjust the frame until it reaches Bram's island.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557186
    m_Key: A light answered from the mill. They're waiting to see if we'll stay lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557187
    m_Key: Then I'll learn to tend it, too. You shouldn't have to keep watch alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557188
    m_Key: The dial agrees with the beacon. My chart was using the old starting mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557189
    m_Key: Let's correct that before checking the stars. The same error could shift
      every route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557190
    m_Key: I watched from the doorway after the bridge broke. It hid half the sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557191
    m_Key: We'll reach the telescope. No wonder you couldn't check those bearings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557192
    m_Key: This torn corner holds the turn after the ridge. Without it, a pilot must
      guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557193
    m_Key: We'll mark that route closed until it's checked. The others can still
      open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557194
    m_Key: That glider follows the first lamps, then circles back. Our next turn
      is still dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557195
    m_Key: Light the turn before signalling him through. He needs a route, not a
      promise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557196
    m_Key: Sora checked our route from the air. She found a lamp hidden behind the
      tower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557197
    m_Key: We'll move it, then ask her to fly once more. This time we check together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557198
    m_Key: Your letter arrived before you did. I kept it beside the window lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557199
    m_Key: Then you know their names. I want you to meet them when the road is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557200
    m_Key: Gran's old route note is in that cabinet. We need to stop the leak to
      reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557201
    m_Key: The islands are familiar, but here every piece is a shape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557202
    m_Key: Another version of our sky. The crossings here still need their own repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557203
    m_Key: Then I'll bring what I learned across, not pretend the work here is already
      done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557204
    m_Key: The same islands... but letters are hanging where the shapes used to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557205
    m_Key: A parallel sky. Here the cargo forms words, and each crossing has its
      own answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557206
    m_Key: I remember you. Let's see what this version of our journey has to say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557207
    m_Key: Shapes beside letters! It's as if our two skies have met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557208
    m_Key: A third path, with both kinds of cargo. A familiar face won't make its
      puzzles familiar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557209
    m_Key: Good. We'll try a new answer instead of following our old footprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557210
    m_Key: Back to shapes. I recognise this bend in the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557211
    m_Key: I kept your place. The other sky can wait while we finish our crossing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557212
    m_Key: We're back among the letters. I remember where we stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557213
    m_Key: Then we can leave the introductions behind and pick up our unfinished
      words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557214
    m_Key: Letters and shapes together again. This is the path we left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557215
    m_Key: Your lantern still marks where we stopped. I'll walk with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1807274946322432
