  - m_Id: 1827980849438720
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the saw. It cuts the branch so you can exchange
      across that gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1827980849438721
    m_Key: Put the pictured piece above the saw. It cuts the branch and opens that
      exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
