    m_Key: Two tools already used this stage. More uses unlock next stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377025
    m_Key: The bulb shows one move; you make it. The counter is for this stage. When
      empty, an optional video adds one hint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377026
    m_Key: The scroll guides you through this board. Follow the hand; it never moves
      pieces for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377027
    m_Key: "The lens previews the row after the next drop, including the next board\u2019s
      effect. It does not move your pieces."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377028
    m_Key: The lantern makes one safe move for you. One item is consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377029
    m_Key: After both free undos, use a spool to undo one more move on this board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377030
    m_Key: Return to the board you just left, with its row and durability restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377031
    m_Key: Tap the bag to open or fold the tray. Tap an available tool to use one.
      At most two tools per stage; using one caps this level at two stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377032
