    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338369
    m_Key: Continue with Apple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338370
    m_Key: Continue with Google
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338371
    m_Key: Continue without an account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338372
    m_Key: You can choose a provider in the secure sign-in window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338373
    m_Key: Your progress is saved on this phone. Sign-in activates when the Apple
      and Google configuration is added.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2209378231902208
    m_Key: Claim trophy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307738161152
    m_Key: If you see my window light, I'm still here. Don't try the broken bridges
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132672
    m_Key: She wrote that before the storm. The beacon is dark, but I can't see her
      window from home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132673
    m_Key: I built that bridge. Twenty winters it stood. Now I can't even put my
      name on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132674
    m_Key: Don't scrape it off yet. How will I know whom to thank when I get across?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132675
    m_Key: You think an old builder can mend this? I've spent three days sorting
      nails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132676
    m_Key: Then you know where every nail is. That's a start. I'll hold the lantern
      for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132677
    m_Key: All right. Pass me the long ones. And tell your gran her bridge builder
      hasn't retired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132678
    m_Key: Tell her yourself when the road is open. She always sets one extra cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132679
    m_Key: Hear that? No mill wheel. I used to complain it woke me before breakfast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132680
    m_Key: There are buckets at every door. Even the little houses have big ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132681
    m_Key: My brother asked if rain could fill them. I said I'd have the mill running
      by lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132682
    m_Key: Which lunch? Today's or yesterday's?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132683
    m_Key: Yesterday's. I turned the wheel too fast and snapped another tooth. He
      saw everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132684
    m_Key: Then let him see you fix it too. My gran says hiding a broken cup never
      mends it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132685
    m_Key: I'll ask him to bring the spare gear. And I'll tell him why we need it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132686
    m_Key: I'll wait by his bucket. This time let's promise water, not a lunchtime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132687
    m_Key: Rue sent us fruit through the storm. I haven't taken her water in weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132688
    m_Key: Bring a watering can. A thank-you might be thirsty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132689
    m_Key: Mind that crooked tree. I planted it the year I learnt to tie my apron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132690
    m_Key: It's taller than your house now. Did you plant it crooked on purpose?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132691
    m_Key: No. I nearly pulled it out. Now the birds nest in the bend I wanted to
      straighten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132692
    m_Key: Then let's leave their bend alone. Gran has room for a crooked tree too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132693
    m_Key: Take these three seeds. Plant one by her window, and keep two in case
      the first sleeps in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132694
    m_Key: I'll write to you when it wakes up. Even if it grows sideways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132695
    m_Key: Sora can find a house from one bent chimney. But the storm has mixed up
      all her letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132696
    m_Key: Perhaps there's a reply from Gran. I'll help look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132697
    m_Key: That's mine. Please leave it. It hasn't got a stamp yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132698
    m_Key: It's worn thin at the folds. Have you been waiting for a stamp for long?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132699
    m_Key: Months. Clara asked me to stay when her mother was ill. I said I had deliveries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132700
    m_Key: Is that what you wrote in the letter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132701
    m_Key: No. Three pages about the weather. Not one word about leaving her alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132702
    m_Key: Start with that word. I'll find you a stamp while you write.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132703
    m_Key: Clara lives across the lagoon. Will you take this? I've finally written
      the first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132704
    m_Key: Come and give it to her. I'll walk beside you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132705
    m_Key: I saw the post bag on the pier. Is Sora waiting outside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132706
    m_Key: Yes. She wants to talk. I can wait here if you'd rather be alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132707
    m_Key: After we mend the pier. Mother built it so visitors could step ashore
      with dry paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132708
    m_Key: I'm glad she thought of that. Mine shake when I look at deep water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132709
    m_Key: Keep them on this board. I'll hold the boat. You needn't prove anything
      to the pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132710
    m_Key: Good. I was afraid it might ask me to swim.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132711
    m_Key: Oscar has the snow-road map. Tell him you'll bring it back. He'll ask
      twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132712
    m_Key: I'll answer twice. I need that road to reach Gran.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326976
    m_Key: My teacher drew this map. It's the last one. If it gets wet, I can't ask
      him for another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326977
    m_Key: Then leave it here. May I copy the road onto the back of my letter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326978
    m_Key: There's a blank turn by the ridge. I always meant to ask him about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326979
    m_Key: Let's leave it blank on mine too. Alice can show us when we get there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326980
    m_Key: Bring back what you find. He left room for notes. I thought I wasn't allowed
      to add any.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326981
    m_Key: He left you a pencil too, didn't he? Keep it sharp for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326982
    m_Key: Alice knows the ridge. Follow her, but don't make her hurry. She never
      asks for a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326983
    m_Key: I'll keep the blanket where I can reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326984
    m_Key: The old turn has fallen away. Your map is wrong here. I've led travellers
      along it for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326985
    m_Key: Then I'm glad we have you, not just the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326986
    m_Key: We'll go around. I said we'd reach the beacon tonight. I shouldn't have
      said tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326987
    m_Key: Gran would rather open her door tomorrow than have us freeze outside it
      today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326988
    m_Key: There's a shelter below. Just until the gust passes. And perhaps a little
      longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326989
    m_Key: Long enough for tea. I'll pour it while you unfold Ben's blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326990
    m_Key: Two flashes in the window. Someone saw our light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326991
    m_Key: That's her signal! Gran, don't come onto the bridge. We're nearly there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326992
    m_Key: Your scarf has a new patch. And my letter has more folds than a concertina.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326993
    m_Key: I kept opening it. I knew the words, but I wanted to hear your voice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326994
    m_Key: Here I am. Come closer. You can put that bag down for a minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326995
    m_Key: Carefully! There are seeds in it. Rose sent you a tree that hasn't happened
      yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326996
    m_Key: We'll find it a pot. Then help me with the beacon. My knees won't carry
      the lamp up anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326997
    m_Key: I'll carry it. You tell me where to shine. Everyone down there is waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326998
    m_Key: The mill answered our beacon. But those gliders keep turning back above
      the clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326999
    m_Key: Felix's route lamps are dark. Take him breakfast. He forgets to eat when
      he worries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327000
    m_Key: That glider followed my chart into a cloud bank. I closed the route before
      anyone else tried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327001
    m_Key: Did the pilot get home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327002
    m_Key: Yes. He came back to show me the wrong turn. I was too ashamed to open
      the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327003
    m_Key: Could we ask him again? We could have breakfast at the telescope while
      we wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327004
    m_Key: I'll send a signal. But we'll check the route from his glider, not just
      from my desk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327005
    m_Key: And leave the door open. He's bringing the bit of sky we couldn't see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327006
    m_Key: You left your name on it! I'll tell Gran her bridge builder is coming
      for tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327007
    m_Key: Your brother heard it first. He's run off with his bucket. Let's see if
      the water reaches him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327008
    m_Key: He filled it without asking you. Look at him trying not to spill a drop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327009
    m_Key: That chick has stopped calling. Its mother found the crooked branch after
      all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327010
    m_Key: I'll take her the waiting letters. Yours can go on top, so she sees your
      handwriting first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327011
    m_Key: I'll draw them for Gran. The real lamp and the one that won't sit still
      in the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327012
    m_Key: I'll bring you a drawing of the beacon. Perhaps the fish would like a
      taller lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327013
    m_Key: Keep a place for Sora at supper. I'll take the snow road after you two
      have talked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327014
    m_Key: Did your teacher write in its margins too? You could show me while my
      scarf dries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327015
    m_Key: Then let's stop halfway. You can tell me which stair squeaks, like you
      used to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327016
    m_Key: I used to whistle on these bridges. Today I can't remember a single tune.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521280
    m_Key: Gran whistles when her soup boils over. I know that one. Shall I start?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521281
    m_Key: I tried tying this branch straight. The tree broke every ribbon I used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521282
    m_Key: Perhaps it wants a bow instead. That's what I ask for when Gran brushes
      my fur.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521283
    m_Key: Walter left a triangle mark on the crate. That must be the timber he promised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521284
    m_Key: He sends the straightest boards away and keeps the crooked ones for his
      own door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521285
    m_Key: Let's save him one straight board. Gran says his door only opens in dry
      weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521286
    m_Key: There's a letter on each parcel. This one spells HOME. Is it for the beacon?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521287
    m_Key: For a family at the mill. They've been sleeping in the storehouse since
      the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521288
    m_Key: Then their parcel goes first. I'll put Gran's letter somewhere dry while
      we carry it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521289
    m_Key: A crate with a square, and a parcel with a letter. Who packed this lot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521290
    m_Key: The whole village. Someone even tied a biscuit to the handle. For the
      journey, they said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521291
    m_Key: I'll deliver everything. Except perhaps the biscuit. It might not survive
      the journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521292
    m_Key: There's Walter's triangle again. We left this crate by the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521293
    m_Key: And it's still dry. I covered it when the rain came. Shall we carry on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521294
    m_Key: The lettered parcels! We left the last one here. Did anyone collect it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521295
    m_Key: Not yet. They asked me to thank you. I'll tell them when the next load
      arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521296
    m_Key: Our mixed delivery is still waiting. I hope nobody ate the biscuit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521297
    m_Key: I put it in the tin. The crumbs were tempting the birds. Here, take it
      before they return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318702
    m_Key: Good morning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318703
    m_Key: Good evening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318704
    m_Key: Good morning! Mika left a lantern glowing for your next little adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318705
    m_Key: Good morning! May your day begin softly and surprise you in a lovely way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318706
    m_Key: Good morning! A fresh path is waiting whenever you have a quiet moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318707
    m_Key: Good evening! Let the day rest; Mika will keep your place on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318708
    m_Key: Good evening! A quiet little puzzle is here whenever you feel like unwinding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318709
    m_Key: Good evening! Wishing you a peaceful night and a lighter tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318710
    m_Key: "You\u2019ve lit {0} paths so far. Mika saved a little light for the next."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521298
    m_Key: No trophies yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3745925842329600
    m_Key: One reminder tomorrow evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
